.RE
.\}
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.sp
As \fBsqlhist\fR is just example code from a man page, it is guaranteed to contain lots of bugs\&. For one thing, not all error paths are covered properly\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
trace\-cmd(1), tracefs_sql(3)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
